==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|sebum|lang=la}}.

===Noun===
{{head|en|noun}}

# {{context|physiology|lang=en}} A thick oily substance, secreted by the [[sebaceous gland]]s of the skin, that consists of [[fat]], [[keratin]] and cellular debris.

